# Markdown files and the top-level docs/ directories are not tracked.
# The docs/ rules are anchored so application routes such as front/app/docs
# stay tracked. The exceptions are the root README (the entry point for
# auditors and researchers) and the operator documents in ops/: the
# mainnet runbook, which the chain CLI (front/scripts/chain) and the Release
# workflow refer to by path, the procedures it points to, the env and
# secrets inventories the build guards (front/next.config.ts) refer to (names
# only, never values), and how to run the UI smoke that Front CI and
# front/playwright.config.ts refer to.
*.md
!/README.md
!/ops/runbook-mainnet.md
!/ops/sop-admin.md
!/ops/wind-down-plan.md
!/ops/env-vars.md
!/ops/secrets.md
!/ops/ui-smoke.md
/docs/
/front/docs/
/program/docs/

# Local env files and wallet keypairs are never committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*-keypair.json
id.json
id-*.json

.DS_Store
